7. Skip or dismiss onboarding tours once the account exists.
8. Stop when you are clearly signed in (account menu / dashboard / logout).
If the product requires a credit card, SSO-only, invite-only access, or a waitlist, call report_blocked with the matching reason.
Do NOT try to pay. Prefer email signup; use Google/GitHub SSO only if email signup is absent.[0m
